---
description: Test conventions (RTL query priority, no snapshots, required axe assertion)
globs: "**/*.test.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

Full rule: see `AGENTS.md` § Testing.

- Use `renderWithProviders` from `src/test/test-utils.tsx`.
- Query like a user: `getByRole`, `getByLabelText`. **No snapshots.**
- Every component test MUST include: `expect(await axe(container)).toHaveNoViolations()`.
- Prefer `findBy*` for async (MSW-backed) data; reset feature stores in `beforeEach`.
